{
  "repo": "URTC-VISION-TOOL",
  "ecosystem": "urtc",
  "tagline": "A thermal and RGB inspection head: the sensor protocol of its firmware and a Python companion that judges what the cameras see.",
  "description": "URTC-VISION-TOOL holds the sensor protocol of the firmware (a versioned frame with a CRC-8, range, rate and freshness checks and diagnostic counters, in pure C) and the vision_companion package, which reads a thermal image from a URTC head over CAN, aligns it with the RGB image, judges the components of a plan and the tips of a tool rack by temperature, and exports the readings. No board exists yet; everything is tested on a computer against simulated heads.",
  "columns": [
    "WHO USES IT",
    "THIS REPOSITORY",
    "WHAT IT READS"
  ],
